Rule 3. Materials to Accompany a Complaint.
(a) Filing. To institute a civil action, a plaintiff must submit the following to the court: 
(1) the original complaint;
(2) the filing fee or a motion and affidavit to proceed in forma pauperis;
(3) a Civil Cover Sheet [form JS 44];
(4) When applicable, a Notice of Lawsuit and Request for Waiver of Service [AO 398 
or Fed. R. Civ. P. Form 5] for each defendant;
